    "custom_tabs_1": {
      "type": "custom-tabs",
      "blocks": {
        "tab_1": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "About Tiles Paradise",
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<p>Four years ago, we started buying tiles straight from the factories that make them. No importer in the middle. No distributor. No showroom with a coffee machine charging you for the decor.</p><p>We bring the stock into our own UK warehouse and ship it to your door — usually the next working day.</p><p>1,000+ customers. 4.8 stars. Not because the brand looks good, but because what we say we'll deliver, we actually deliver.</p><p>Porcelain tiles, bathroom products, LED mirrors, heated towel rails, toilets, shower sets. Everything you need for a renovation, from one place, at prices the high street can't justify.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_2": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Own the Room",
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<p>Most people spend weeks scrolling tile websites, overwhelmed by choice and let down by photos that look nothing like the tile in real life.</p><p>Here's what we do instead.</p><p>Order a sample. We cut it, we post it, you hold it in your actual room in your actual light. If it's right, you buy. If not, try another. We refund the sample cost against your order.</p><p>No guessing. No returns because the colour was wrong on screen.</p><p>200+ tiles in stock. Marble effect, onyx, gloss, matt, outdoor — ready to ship.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_3": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ready to Renovate?",
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<p>Renovations go wrong for three reasons. Products take too long. Something arrives damaged and no one answers. Or you've ordered from five different websites and nothing matches when it gets there.</p><p>We fix all three.</p><p>Tiles, mirrors, toilets, radiators, shower sets — all held in our UK warehouse. Most orders ship the next working day. Tiles go out on fully-wrapped pallets because porcelain chips and we'd rather not deal with that.</p><p>If anything arrives damaged, photograph it while it's still on the pallet. Tell us within two working days. We'll sort a replacement — no argument.</p><p>One supplier. One delivery. One person to call.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_4": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "One Change. Different Room.",
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<p>You don't always need to gut the bathroom.</p><p>Sometimes it's the floor tiles. Sometimes it's swapping the mirror for an LED one with anti-fog. Sometimes a brushed gold towel rail changes the whole feel of the room.</p><p>We sell exactly those things. Individual pieces that make a room look deliberate without the cost or mess of a full renovation.</p><p>Pick one thing. See what it does.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_5": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How Buying From Us Works",
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<p>Browse. Order a sample if you're unsure — we deliver it, you decide, we knock it off your first order.</p><p>When you're ready, check out with PayPal, Klarna, or card. 0% interest-free finance available if you want to spread the cost.</p><p>Your order ships from our UK warehouse within 1–3 working days. Tiles travel on pallets — not because we're overcautious, but because that's the only way to get porcelain to your door without it cracking.</p><p>If anything goes sideways, WhatsApp or live chat us. 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. A real person responds — not a bot reading from a script.</p>"
          }
        },
        "tab_6": {
          "type": "tab",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What We Actually Stand For",
            "heading": "",
            "content": "<p>We're four years old. We don't have a showroom or a 500-seat call centre.</p><p>What we have is a direct relationship with the factories, our own UK warehouse, and a team that replies in minutes — not working days.</p><p>Our goal is simple: fewer problems on delivery day, better prices, and someone who picks up when something goes wrong.</p><p>4.8 stars. 1,000+ reviews. Every one from a real customer who placed a real order.</p><p>Got a question before you buy? Ask on live chat, WhatsApp, or email. Same team. Same response time. Any hour.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "tab_1",
        "tab_2",
        "tab_3",
        "tab_4",
        "tab_5",
        "tab_6"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "bg_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
        "active_color": "#016fd0",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 40
      }
    },
